+ * 4. Bound: val <= MAX_POSITION_RISK_R (100.0R).
+ * 5. Precision: at most 4 decimal places (0.0001R). Rejects unsupported precision fail-closed.
+ * 6. Safe integer: Math.round(val * 1_000_000) is a safe integer.
